   - What happened: C+ #49 Jay Fungus, which had Immune to Spells, evolved at the settled state check, and I21 already allows that `evolved` under R4623000. Then its queued Evolve text ("Gain Poisonous") ran. That run has no `hookResolving` marker, because `hook_marks::hook_kind_of` names no `evolve` hook. So its `keywordGranted` landed in the open run of M #21 API Key Fishing's end-of-turn hook, and I21 blamed the Spell.
